<li id="foot_krm_0033_06"><a href="#ref_krm_0033_06">↑</a> [[१। ‘उपसर्गस्यायतौ’ (८-२-१९) इति लत्वम्।]]</li> <li id="foot_krm_0033_07"><a href="#ref_krm_0033_07">↑</a> [[४। ‘अयनं च’ (८-४-२५) इति णत्वम्।]]</li> <li id="foot_krm_0033_08"><a href="#ref_krm_0033_08">↑</a> (देशादन्यत्र)</li> <li id="foot_krm_0033_09"><a href="#ref_krm_0033_09">↑</a> [पृष्ठम्००३३+ ३४]</li></ul></p>

